+// ArtifactStat reads a physical artifact's complete stat contribution, even
+// when that stat is absent from the captured damage graph. As with
+// AssignmentStat, any nonempty coordinate key absent from the piece is zero;
+// an unknown artifact is an error, not a synthetic empty piece. Callers own
